  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: Ancanofrontation2WEIRD
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ... oh.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732564
    - rid: 268099729075732571
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=0.5,1>I get it now</NoiseText>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732565
    - rid: 268099729075732566
    - rid: 268099729075732567
    - rid: 268099729075732582
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=0.5,1>How could I have not noticed it sooner, fufufu</NoiseText>...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732568
    - rid: 268099729075732569
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=0.5,1>Of course trials and tribulations follow us wherever
      we go, we are just characters in a story</NoiseText>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732572
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Ancano tries to fire an ice spike at Yuri, now that she seems to have
      made herself an easy target...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732576
    - rid: 268099729075732577
    - rid: 268099729075732580
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732573
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732581
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=0.5,1>Now, if {mc} is the main character, that would make
      the rest of us side characters</NoiseText>-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732583
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh... Y-Yuri...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732584
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=0.5,1>Oh, it's okay Sayori, we're going to be perfectly fine</NoiseText>.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732585
    - rid: 268099729075732586
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=0.5,1>Since {mc} already knew about all of this, there's no
      way that we'll be defeated by this fodder tension-builder</NoiseText>.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3a4fe2bf30f193641a10aa95dbb7f4df, type: 2}
    dialog: Fodder tension-builder?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri summons her dagger to do battle with Ancano.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732588
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732589
    - rid: 268099729075732590
    - rid: 268099729075732591
    - rid: 268099729075732592
    - rid: 268099729075732605
    - rid: 268099729075732593
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Now that the battle is over, Sayori drops the Staff down to the floor
      so she can focus on healing herself.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732596
    - rid: 268099795830177855
    - rid: 268099729075732598
    - rid: 268099729075732604
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=0.5,1>I wonder what's going to be the next challenge on our
      journey</NoiseText>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177862
    - rid: 268099795830177861
    - rid: 268099729075732609
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=0.5,1>Hopefully it's something {mc} hasn't seen before; it'd
      be more narratively satisfying that way</NoiseText>.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177860
    - rid: 268099795830177859
    - rid: 268099729075732611
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri, <i>what are you even talking about</i>?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732619
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=0.5,1>The truth of this world, Sayori</NoiseText>...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732620
    - rid: 268099729075732621
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=0.5,1>We're all just in one big story!</NoiseText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732622
    - rid: 268099729075732623
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh no, she's gone crazy!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732624
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (I don't even know where {mc} is...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732626
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, Y-Yuri... are you sure that's... right?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732627
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=0.5,1>Well of course I'm sure! That's the only reasonable
      explanation</NoiseText>-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732628
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, didn't {mc} say that this world was following the story of the
      game?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099729075732629
    - rid: 268099729075732630
    - rid: 268099729075732631
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Is that what you were talking about, Yuri?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177864
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I- n-no, but I thought...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177886
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177865
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Now that I'm thinking about it some more, that makes more sense.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177866
    - rid: 268099795830177867
    - rid: 268099795830177868
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: It's not that we're just some characters in a story, we're real people
      stuck in a story-bound world.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177869
    - rid: 268099795830177870
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, what?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177871
    - rid: 268099795830177872
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 251ab17588978ca44861c552397cfd18, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, now that Ancano's gone, what should we do about the Eye?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177876
    - rid: 268099795830177877
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
